t oppslag i Altinn 2-datalageret, og hvis ingenting finnes der, overføres forespørselen til Altinn 3. [2]\n\nDet er altså ikke én helt ny separat arkitektur, men en **overgangsarkitektur der Altinn 2 og Altinn 3 sameksisterer**, med en intern bro i Altinn 2 som styrer overføringen til Altinn 3. [1][3][4]\n\nHvis du vil, kan jeg også oppsummere dette som et enkelt flytdiagram i tekstform.", :search-errors [], :search-passes 1}, :error nil, :id "altinn-broker-technical-overview", :improved false, :query "Hva er den tekniske arkitekturen bak Altinn Broker i overgangsfasen?", :regressed true, :relaxed {:answer-pass true, :budget-state {:low-read-budget? true, :low-search-budget? false, :max-read-content-length 16000, :max-read-operations 6, :max-search-passes 4, :read-content-budget-exhausted? false, :read-content-length-remaining 1231, :read-content-length-used 14769, :read-operations-exhausted? false, :read-operations-remaining 1, :read-operations-used 5, :search-budget-exhausted? false, :search-passes-remaining 3, :search-passes-used 1}, :durations-ms {:total 45403.588458}, :error nil, :golden-present false, :inspection {:largest-read {:chunk-range {:from 0, :to 4}, :content-length 6526, :doc-num "b6c43b81c669", :mode :doc-range, :operation 2, :returned-chunks [{:chunk-id "3815339142c4", :chunk-index 0, :content-length 417, :doc-num "b6c43b81c669", :title "Technical overview"} {:chunk-id "63e3857a5897", :chunk-index 1, :content-length 385, :doc-num "b6c43b81c669", :title "Technical overview"} {:chunk-id "01fdec6b497d", :chunk-index 2, :content-length 2528, :doc-num "b6c43b81c669", :title "Technical overview"}], :returned-count 5}, :reads [{:chunk-range {:from 0, :to 0}, :content-length 628, :doc-num "a336d6bb019e", :mode :doc-range, :operation 1, :returned-chunks [{:chunk-id "94f0fa820e54", :chunk-index 0, :content-length 628, :doc-num "a336d6bb019e", :title "Broker transition"}], :returned-count 1} {:chunk-range {:from 0, :to 4}, :content-length 6526, :doc-num "b6c4